	al club performance. \nAbout Brea Improv\nThe Brea Improv is one of Southe
	rn California’s premier comedy clubs\, located at 180 S Brea Blvd in Brea\
	, CA. Part of the legendary Improv comedy club chain\, it features an inti
	mate showroom setting with full food and beverage service. \nWhat to Expec
	t\n\nBrutally honest\, darkly funny stand-up from a comedy veteran\nNew sh
	ow: Doomed to Repeat\nIntimate club setting with full food & beverage serv
	ice\n21+ event — valid ID required at the door\nTwo-item minimum purchase 
