SUMMARY:DoKnow LIVE at Cobb's Comedy Club
DTSTAMP:20260719T101341Z
DTSTART:20260719T190000Z
DESCRIPTION:Official TicketsResale Tickets \nThis post contains affiliate l
	inks. We may earn a commission at no extra cost to you. \nAbout the Perfor
	mer\nDoKnow is a dynamic and energetic stand-up comedian who has been maki
	ng waves in the comedy world with his high-energy performances and infecti
	ous personality. Known for his quick wit\, clever wordplay\, and ability t
	o connect with audiences of all backgrounds\, DoKnow delivers comedy that 
	is both entertaining and thought-provoking. \nWith a growing national prof
	ile and a dedicated fanbase\, DoKnow has been steadily building his reputa
	tion as one of the most exciting voices in contemporary stand-up comedy. H
	is live shows are known for their unpredictability\, audience engagement\,
	 and non-stop laughs from the moment he hits the stage. This performance a
	t Cobb’s Comedy Club is a must-see for comedy fans in the Bay Area. \nEven
	t Details\n\nDate: Sunday\, July 19\, 2026\nTime: 7:00 PM (Doors open earl
	ier)\nVenue: Cobb’s Comedy Club\, 915 Columbus Avenue\, San Francisco\, CA
	 94133\nAge Requirement: 18+ (Valid photo ID required)\nBeverage Minimum: 
	2 beverages per person\n\nAbout the Venue\nCobb’s Comedy Club has been a c
	ornerstone of San Francisco’s entertainment scene for decades. Located at 
	915 Columbus Avenue in the iconic North Beach neighborhood\, the club is s
	urrounded by great restaurants\, bars\, and the vibrant energy of one of S
	F’s most beloved districts. \nThe venue accommodates approximately 400 gue
	sts in a classic comedy club setup with general admission seating. Tables 
	and chairs are arranged to give every guest a great view of the stage\, an
	d the intimate size of the room ensures a personal\, connected experience 
	between performer and audience. A full bar is available\, and the two-beve
	rage minimum per person applies to all shows. \nParking can be found on ne
	arby streets and in garages throughout the North Beach area. Plan to arriv
	e at least 20 minutes before showtime to find parking and get comfortable.
	 The venue is also accessible via BART and Muni bus lines. \nWhat to Expec
	t\nDoKnow’s live show is a high-energy\, laugh-filled experience from star
	t to finish. His comedy style blends personal storytelling with sharp obse
	rvations about everyday life\, pop culture\, and social dynamics. Expect a
	 comedian who is fully in command of the stage and committed to giving the
	 audience the best possible show. \nThe performance runs approximately 75-
	90 minutes and is recommended for adult audiences. DoKnow’s natural charis
	ma and comedic instincts make every show feel fresh and spontaneous. Wheth
	er you’re a longtime fan or seeing him for the first time\, this is a Sund
	ay night comedy experience you won’t want to miss. \nTicket Information\nT
	ickets start at $32.05 (General Admission\, includes fees). Seating is gen
	eral admission — first come\, first served within sections. Tickets are no
	n-refundable and non-exchangeable. \nOfficial TicketsResale Tickets\n\nhtt
	ps://comedycalendar.com/event/doknow-live-at-cobbs-comedy-club/\n\nFrom Co
	medy Calendar
URL:https://comedycalendar.com/event/doknow-live-at-cobbs-comedy-club/
LOCATION:Cobb’s Comedy Club\, 915 Columbus Avenue\, San Francisco\, Califor
	nia\, 94133\, United States Of America
