DESCRIPTION:Official TicketsResale Tickets \nAbout the Performer\nLuenell i
	s one of the most electrifying and fearless stand-up comedians in the game
	\, known for her explosive energy\, raw honesty\, and unapologetically bol
	d humor. \nShe gained widespread recognition through her breakout role in 
	the hit film Borat and has since appeared in Hotel Transylvania\, Coming 2
	 America\, and numerous television specials\, cementing her status as a co
	medy powerhouse. \nLuenell’s stand-up is a force of nature — loud\, proud\
	, and hilarious — tackling everything from relationships and pop culture t
	o her own life experiences with a no-filter authenticity that audiences ab
	solutely love. \nEvent Details\n\nDate: Monday\, July 20\, 2026\nShow Time
	: 9:30 PM (doors open earlier)\nVenue: Jimmy Kimmel’s Comedy Club\, 3545 S
	 Las Vegas Blvd\, Las Vegas\, NV 89109\nAge Restriction: 18+ Event\nTicket
	 Prices: From $63\n\nAbout the Venue\nJimmy Kimmel’s Comedy Club is one of
	 the premier comedy destinations on the Las Vegas Strip\, located on the i
	conic LINQ Promenade at 3545 S Las Vegas Blvd. \nThe intimate venue seats 
	approximately 300 guests and features a state-of-the-art sound system\, ex
	cellent sightlines from every seat\, and full bar service throughout the s
	how. \nThe club’s cozy atmosphere creates an up-close-and-personal comedy 
	experience unlike the large arena shows Vegas is known for. Parking is ava
	ilable at the LINQ Hotel parking garage\, and the venue is easily accessib
	le via the Las Vegas Monorail. \nThe LINQ Promenade itself offers a variet
	y of dining and entertainment options before and after the show\, making i
	t a perfect evening destination on the Strip. \nWhat to Expect\nLuenell de
	livers a headline solo stand-up performance that is guaranteed to be one o
	f the most energetic and entertaining shows you’ll see in Las Vegas. \nExp
	ect a high-octane\, laugh-until-you-cry performance where Luenell’s magnet
	ic stage presence and fearless humor take center stage. She commands the r
	oom from the moment she walks out\, and her connection with the audience i
	s electric. \nThis is a 18+ event\, and Luenell’s material is adult-orient
	ed\, unfiltered\, and absolutely hilarious. Arrive early to secure your se
	ats and enjoy the full experience at this intimate venue. \nTicket Informa
	tion\nTickets start from $63 and are available through official and resale
	 channels. \nOfficial TicketsResale Tickets \nThis post contains affiliate
	 links. We may earn a commission at no extra cost to you.\n\nhttps://comed
	ycalendar.com/event/luenell-live-at-jimmy-kimmels-comedy-club/\n\nFrom Com
	edy Calendar
