	ch Line Irving\nEngaging storytelling and crowd interaction\nFull bar serv
	ice with a 2-drink minimum\n\nVenue Information\nPunch Line Irving is loca
	ted in the heart of Las Colinas at 310 W Las Colinas Blvd.\, Suite 130\, I
	rving\, TX. This premier comedy club offers an intimate atmosphere with fu
	ll bar service\, making it the perfect spot for a night out in the Dallas-
	Fort Worth area. \nTicket Information\nTickets start at approximately $32 
